      ],
      "source": "https://denmark.net/hellerup/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The area was once open countryside with scattered country houses until the 18th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hellerup"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1748 Johan David Heller bought Lokkerup, renaming it Hellerupgård, giving the area its name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hellerup"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The former Tuborg Brewery site now hosts Tuborg Havn, a waterfront shopping center and marina.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hellerup"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Øregaard Museum, housed in a former mansion, showcases Danish Golden Age paintings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
